*> vybe-test: cobol/currency_sign/currency_sign_runtime_basic_output
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_currency_sign.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CUR11.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SPECIAL-NAMES.
    CURRENCY SIGN IS "$".
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
01 AMT PIC $9.99 VALUE $12.34.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    IF AMT > 0
        DISPLAY "HAS_SIGN"
    END-IF
    STOP RUN.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING "HAS_SIGN" DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "HAS_SIGN"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [HAS_SIGN] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.

